Expected Performance
If regime has genuine predictive power:
Win Rate: 52-58%, Sharpe: 1.0-1.6, Max DD: 9-14%, Profit Factor: 1.2-1.5

If regime has NO predictive power:
Walk-forward Sharpe < 0.5, regime accuracy < 55%
Action: abandon HMM, consider simpler VIX-only threshold system

