India VIX short history	Reduce warmup to 60 days
HMM overfits training window	Walk-forward validation catches this
Regime-dependency (Kalman lesson)	Circuit breaker + walk-forward across ALL periods
hmmlearn numerical instability	n_iter=200, tol=1e-4, fallback to 'diag' covariance
